          "text": "Great — here are four Australian candy gift-box options that will deliver to Sydney, with a short note on price and delivery for each so you can pick what suits best.\n\n- Edible Blooms — \"Lollies & Sweets (9 Pack)\": same‑day delivery available in Sydney (hand‑packed gift box). Price shown $85 and same‑day/express options on the product page. ([edibleblooms.com.au](https://www.edibleblooms.com.au/products/lollies-sweets-9-pack))\n\n- Snack Box Hampers — \"Mega Zest Lolly Box (Fun Size)\": nostalgic Aussie favourites (Allen’s, Wizz Fizz, Minties, etc.), budget option around $55 with Australia‑wide shipping (free shipping noted on the page). Good value for a classic mix. ([snackboxhampers.com.au](https://snackboxhampers.com.au/product/lolly-box-gift-hamper-fun-size/))\n\n- The Old Lolly Shop — \"The Golden Years Box\": a premium, nostalgic curated box (classic/retro sweets), price $60; the shop ships Australia‑wide (free shipping over $100; dispatch 1–2 business days). Nice choice if you want a more nostalgic/premium presentation. ([theoldlollyshop.com.au](https://theoldlollyshop.com.au/products/the-golden-years-box))\n\n- The Sweet Giftorium — custom Pick‑n‑Mix / Premium Lolly Gift Boxes: build your own or choose pre‑made boxes (options from ~ $28–$120 depending on size); they ship Australia‑wide and offer personalised packing. Good if you want to tailor for allergies/flavours. ([thesweetgiftorium.com.au](https://thesweetgiftorium.com.au/))\n\nIf you tell me:\n- Your budget, and\n- Whether you want same‑day delivery to Sydney and/or any dietary/allergy needs (gluten‑free, nut‑free, vegetarian), and\n- Who the gift is for (kid, adult, nostalgic touch, corporate),\n\nI’ll pick the best single box for your needs and can include the exact checkout link and delivery estimate for your chosen delivery date."
